msgstr "更複雜的 I2C 裝置可使用完整的事件集來實作。例如，查看事件被觸發時的原始事件::"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:81
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "建構式"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:85
msgid ""
"Construct and return a new I2CTarget object using the following parameters:"
msgstr "使用下列參數建構並回傳一個新的 I2CTarget 物件："

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:87
msgid ""
"*id* identifies a particular I2C peripheral.  Allowed values depend on the "
"particular port/board.  Some ports have a default in which case this "
"parameter can be omitted."
msgstr "*id* 用於識別特定的 I2C 周邊裝置。允許的值取決於特定的 port/開發板。某些 port 具有預設值，此情況下可省略此參數。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:90
msgid "*addr* is the I2C address of the target."
msgstr "*addr* 是目標的 I2C 位址。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:91
msgid ""
"*addrsize* is the number of bits in the I2C target address.  Valid values "
"are 7 and 10."
msgstr "*addrsize* 是 I2C 目標位址的位元數。有效值為 7 與 10。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:93
msgid ""
"*mem* is an object with the buffer protocol that is writable.  If not "
"specified then there is no backing memory and data must be read/written "
"using the :meth:`I2CTarget.readinto` and :meth:`I2CTarget.write` methods."
msgstr ""
"*mem* 是一個具備緩衝協定且可寫入的物件。若未指定，則沒有後備記憶體，資料必須使用 :meth:`I2CTarget.readinto` 與 "
":meth:`I2CTarget.write` 方法進行讀寫。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:96
msgid ""
"*mem_addrsize* is the number of bits in the memory address.  Valid values "
"are 0, 8, 16, 24 and 32."
msgstr "*mem_addrsize* 是記憶體位址的位元數。有效值為 0、8、16、24 與 32。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:98
msgid "*scl* is a pin object specifying the pin to use for SCL."
msgstr "*scl* 是一個接腳物件，指定要用於 SCL 的接腳。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:99
msgid "*sda* is a pin object specifying the pin to use for SDA."
msgstr "*sda* 是一個接腳物件，指定要用於 SDA 的接腳。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:101
msgid ""
"Note that some ports/boards will have default values of *scl* and *sda* that"
" can be changed in this constructor.  Others will have fixed values of *scl*"
" and *sda* that cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"請注意，某些 port/開發板會有 *scl* 與 *sda* 的預設值，可在此建構式中變更。其他則會有無法變更的 *scl* 與 *sda* 固定值。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:106
msgid "General Methods"
msgstr "一般方法"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:110
msgid ""
"Deinitialise the I2C target.  After this method is called the hardware will "
"no longer respond to requests on the I2C bus, and no other methods can be "
"called."
msgstr "解除初始化 I2C 目標。呼叫此方法之後，硬體將不再回應 I2C 匯流排上的請求，且無法再呼叫其他方法。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:115
msgid ""
"Read into the given buffer any pending bytes written by the I2C controller. "
"Returns the number of bytes read."
msgstr "將 I2C 控制器寫入的任何待處理位元組讀取至給定的緩衝區。回傳讀取的位元組數。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:120
msgid ""
"Write out the bytes from the given buffer, to be passed to the I2C "
"controller after it sends a read request.  Returns the number of bytes "
"written.  Most ports only accept one byte at a time to this method."
msgstr "從給定的緩衝區寫出位元組，以便在 I2C 控制器送出讀取請求後傳遞給它。回傳寫入的位元組數。大多數 port 此方法一次只接受一個位元組。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:126
msgid ""
"Install an IRQ ``handler`` that is invoked when one of the events selected "
"by ``trigger`` fires. ``trigger`` is a bitmask of :data:`IRQ_*` constants "
"OR'd together; the default fires on the end of every controller-side read or"
" write."
msgstr ""
"安裝一個 IRQ ``handler``\\ ，當 ``trigger`` 所選擇的其中一個事件觸發時即會被調用。\\ ``trigger`` 是由 "
":data:`IRQ_*` 常數以 OR 運算組合而成的位元遮罩；預設在每次控制器端讀取或寫入結束時觸發。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:131
msgid ""
"``hard=True`` registers a hard-interrupt handler (no heap allocation in the "
"callback). The default is a scheduled callback. Pass ``handler=None`` to "
"disable the interrupt."
msgstr ""
"``hard=True`` 會註冊一個硬中斷處理常式（回呼函式中不進行堆積配置）。預設為排程式回呼函式。傳入 ``handler=None`` "
"以停用該中斷。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:137
msgid ""
":data:`IRQ_ADDR_MATCH_READ`, :data:`IRQ_ADDR_MATCH_WRITE`, "
":data:`IRQ_READ_REQ` and :data:`IRQ_WRITE_REQ` must be handled by a hard IRQ"
" callback (``hard=True``) because the events have to be acknowledged "
"synchronously with the hardware. :data:`IRQ_END_READ` and "
":data:`IRQ_END_WRITE` may be handled by either soft or hard callbacks; all "
"events share a single handler, so if any event needs a hard callback they "
"all do."
msgstr ""
":data:`IRQ_ADDR_MATCH_READ`\\ 、\\ :data:`IRQ_ADDR_MATCH_WRITE`\\ 、\\ "
":data:`IRQ_READ_REQ` 與 :data:`IRQ_WRITE_REQ` 必須由硬 IRQ 回呼函式（\\ "
"``hard=True``\\ ）處理，因為這些事件必須與硬體同步地被確認。\\ :data:`IRQ_END_READ` 與 "
":data:`IRQ_END_WRITE` 可由軟或硬回呼函式處理；所有事件共用單一處理常式，因此若有任一事件需要硬回呼函式，則全部都需要。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:146
msgid ""
"When a memory buffer is supplied to the constructor the driver suppresses "
":data:`IRQ_END_WRITE` for the transaction that just writes the memory "
"address. This keeps the end-of-transaction events meaningful even when the "
"soft-IRQ scheduler defers the callback."
msgstr ""
"當建構式提供記憶體緩衝區時，驅動程式會抑制僅寫入記憶體位址之交易的 :data:`IRQ_END_WRITE`\\ 。即使軟 IRQ "
"排程器延後了回呼函式，這也能使交易結束事件保持有意義。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:154
msgid ""
"The integer value of the most recent memory address that was selected by the"
" I2C controller (only valid if ``mem`` was specified in the constructor)."
msgstr "I2C 控制器最近所選定之記憶體位址的整數值（僅在建構式中指定了 ``mem`` 時有效）。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:158
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:160
msgid ""
"Each :data:`IRQ_*` constant is a flag bit. OR them together to build a "
"``trigger`` mask for :meth:`irq`. Inside the handler the set of fired events"
" can be recovered via ``self.irq().flags()`` AND'd with each constant."
msgstr ""
"每個 :data:`IRQ_*` 常數都是一個旗標位元。將它們以 OR 運算組合，以建立供 :meth:`irq` 使用的 ``trigger`` "
"遮罩。在處理常式內部，可透過 ``self.irq().flags()`` 與各常數進行 AND 運算來取得已觸發的事件集。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:168
msgid ""
"Fires when a controller addresses this target for a read transaction (the "
"address byte has been received with the read/write bit set to ``1``). Hard-"
"IRQ only."
msgstr "當控制器為了讀取交易而對此目標定址時觸發（位址位元組已收到，且讀寫位元設為 ``1``\\ ）。僅限硬 IRQ。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:175
msgid ""
"Fires when a controller addresses this target for a write transaction (the "
"address byte has been received with the read/write bit set to ``0``). Hard-"
"IRQ only."
msgstr "當控制器為了寫入交易而對此目標定址時觸發（位址位元組已收到，且讀寫位元設為 ``0``\\ ）。僅限硬 IRQ。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:182
msgid ""
"Fires when the controller is requesting a byte from the target. The handler "
"must call :meth:`write` to supply the byte before the controller's clock "
"cycle completes. Hard-IRQ only."
msgstr "當控制器向目標請求一個位元組時觸發。處理常式必須在控制器的時脈週期完成前呼叫 :meth:`write` 以提供該位元組。僅限硬 IRQ。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:190
msgid ""
"Fires when the controller has clocked in a byte to the target. The handler "
"must call :meth:`readinto` to retrieve the byte before the controller sends "
"the next one. Hard-IRQ only."
msgstr ""
"當控制器已將一個位元組時脈輸入至目標時觸發。處理常式必須在控制器送出下一個位元組之前呼叫 :meth:`readinto` 以取得該位元組。僅限硬 "
"IRQ。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:198
msgid ""
"Fires when the controller has finished a read transaction (received STOP / "
"repeated START). May be handled by either a hard or soft IRQ callback."
msgstr "當控制器完成一次讀取交易（收到 STOP / 重複的 START）時觸發。可由硬或軟 IRQ 回呼函式處理。"

#: ../../library/machine.I2CTarget.rst:205
msgid ""
"Fires when the controller has finished a write transaction (received STOP / "
"repeated START). May be handled by either a hard or soft IRQ callback. "
"Suppressed for the transaction that writes the memory address when a ``mem``"
" buffer was supplied to the constructor."
msgstr ""
"當控制器完成一次寫入交易（收到 STOP / 重複的 START）時觸發。可由硬或軟 IRQ 回呼函式處理。當建構式提供了 ``mem`` "
"緩衝區時，會抑制僅寫入記憶體位址之交易的此事件。"
